From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 09:36:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: pmu: Add the Apple T8132 (M4) PMU

The T8132 (M4) has one E and one P cluster of the same core generation as
the T6040 (M4 Pro). Add apple,t8132-pmu, one compatible for the SoC, as
for the T6040 and T8140, so a single PMU instance can cover both clusters.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: LLM
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/pmu.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/pmu.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/pmu.yaml
index b0bdbf5fdc..2229287d83 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/pmu.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/pmu.yaml
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@ properties:
           - apple,firestorm-pmu
           - apple,icestorm-pmu
           - apple,t6040-pmu
+          - apple,t8132-pmu
           - apple,t8140-pmu
           - arm,armv8-pmuv3 # Only for s/w models
           - arm,arm1136-pmu
